  entries:
  - contentId: guest-company-profile-content
    title: Company Profile 2027.pdf
    pages:
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab919a2cad478de4cbecd2e9ff92b8a6, type: 3}
      thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab919a2cad478de4cbecd2e9ff92b8a6, type: 3}
      displayWidth: 800
      searchableText: 'NORTHSTAR GROUP

        TEAM MEMBER GUIDE

        2027 EDITION

        A
        helpful resource for understanding our company, policies, and professional
        standards'
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 54135ed73882ac749b015058defe86db, type: 3}
      thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 54135ed73882ac749b015058defe86db, type: 3}
      displayWidth: 800
      searchableText: 'Table of Contents

        01  Welcome Message

        02 
        About Our Company

        03  Mission, Vision & Values

        04  Meet
        The Team

        05  Workplace Guidelines

        06  Employee Benefits

        07 
        Code Of Conduct

        08  Contact Information'
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2c62e03efe7f7b34fb925df00abbe5ba, type: 3}
      thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2c62e03efe7f7b34fb925df00abbe5ba, type: 3}
      displayWidth: 800
      searchableText: "01\nWELCOME!\nTO OUR TEAM\nWelcome to Northstar! We\u2019re
        a team of curious thinkers, problem-solvers, and collaborators who believe
        great work begins with great people. Whether you\u2019re joining us for the
        first time or getting to know our company, we\u2019re glad you\u2019re here.\nEvery
        team member brings a unique perspective that helps us move forward. We encourage
        you to ask questions, share ideas, and build meaningful connections as we
        work together to create practical solutions and lasting value.\nAt Northstar
        Group, your journey is an opportunity to learn, contribute, and make a difference.
        We\u2019re here to support you as you settle in, discover your strengths,
        and take on new challenges."
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e67bc100d8d14d846acd804d9dbd0e62, type: 3}
      thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e67bc100d8d14d846acd804d9dbd0e62, type: 3}
      displayWidth: 800
      searchableText: '02

        About Our Company

        NORTHSTAR GROUP

        Northstar
        Group helps businesses turn ideas into meaningful experiences through design,
        technology, and strategic thinking. We work closely with our clients to understand
        their challenges and develop creative solutions that strengthen their brands,
        connect with their audiences, and support lasting growth.

        Founded:
        2022

        Location: USA

        Team Members: 100+

        Industry:
        Tech Solutions'
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c3f44065811cf6f48910136bd15c00df, type: 3}
      thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c3f44065811cf6f48910136bd15c00df, type: 3}
      displayWidth: 800
      searchableText: "03\nMission, Vision & Values \nMission\nOur mission is to
        help organizations solve complex challenges through thoughtful consulting,
        practical technology, and strong partnerships. We empower our people to turn
        ideas into solutions that improve how businesses work and serve their communities.\nVision\nOur
        vision is to become a trusted partner for organizations building a more adaptable
        and sustainable future. We aspire to create a workplace where people grow,
        collaboration drives progress, and our work delivers lasting benefits for
        clients and communities.\nValues\n- Integrity\n- Teamwork\n- Innovation\n-
        Excellence\n- Respect\n- Growth"
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 325eba8ea2f2b2544a232088724e65ae, type: 3}
      thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 325eba8ea2f2b2544a232088724e65ae, type: 3}
      displayWidth: 800
      searchableText: '04

        Meet Our Team

        Founder/CEO

        Karla
        Torres

        Project Manager

        Alanis Cubi

        Creative Director

        Dana
        Hamayel

        Marketing Manager

        Fabiola Ramos'
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bc9b13339e70c7941a8bae468f03abe6, type: 3}
      thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bc9b13339e70c7941a8bae468f03abe6, type: 3}
      displayWidth: 800
      searchableText: "05\nWorkplace Guidelines\n1. Respect Everyone\n   Promote
        an inclusive workplace by listening to others and treating every colleague
        fairly.\n2. Communication Standards\n   Share information clearly and maintain
        professional workplace communication.\n3. Attendance Policy\n   Follow attendance
        guidelines and update your team when required.\n4. Privacy Guidelines\n  
        Protect important information and respect workplace confidentiality.\n5.
        Team Collaboration\n   Support teamwork, cooperation, and positive working
        relationships."
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a4c4057170c03ec4e8fe2d7133dd0d1d, type: 3}
      thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a4c4057170c03ec4e8fe2d7133dd0d1d, type: 3}
      displayWidth: 800
      searchableText: '06

        Employee Benefits

        We support our employees
        with benefits that promote wellbeing, professional growth, and a healthy
        balance between work and personal life. Our benefits package helps team members
        feel supported throughout their time at Northstar.

        - Learning Programs

        -
        Health & Wellness

        - Career Growth

        - Flexible Workplace

        -
        Performance Rewards

        - Team Activities'
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2655b47518521ed47b1950577fc1eafd, type: 3}
      thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2655b47518521ed47b1950577fc1eafd, type: 3}
      displayWidth: 800
      searchableText: '07

        Code of Conduct

        - Treat colleagues, clients,
        and partners with dignity and respect.

        - Maintain a workplace free
        from harassment, discrimination, and bullying.

        - Act honestly and
        avoid conflicts of interest.

        - Protect confidential company, employee,
        and client information.

        - Use company resources responsibly and
        for authorized purposes.

        NORTHSTAR GROUP'
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d2affd269fd515c48a6eec4619062b3f, type: 3}
      thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d2affd269fd515c48a6eec4619062b3f, type: 3}
      displayWidth: 800
      searchableText: '08

        Contact Information

        125 Northstar Avenue,

        Ashford,
        Minnesota

        WEBSITE

        www.northstargroup.com

        CONTACT
        NUMBER

        +123-456-7890

        EMAIL

        hello@northstar.com

        GET
        IN TOUCH

        NORTHSTAR GROUP'
